<StudioLayout title="Administration" code="ADMIN">
<section class="head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SYSTEM // 006</div><h1>ADMINISTRATION</h1></div><div class="headmeta">CONTROL PLANE<br/>V0.2</div></section>
<div class="grid"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>INFRASTRUCTURE</span><span class="dim">ACTUAL STATE</span></div><div class="services"><div class="service"><span>PAGES PREVIEW</span><span class="status ok">● ONLINE</span></div><div class="service"><span>OPENDAW</span><span class="status ok">● EXTERNAL</span></div><div class="service"><span>LOCAL STATE</span><span class="status ok">● ACTIVE</span></div><div class="service"><span>R2 STORAGE</span><span>NOT LINKED</span></div><div class="service"><span>D1 DATABASE</span><span>NOT LINKED</span></div><div class="service"><span>VIDEO WORKER</span><span>NOT LINKED</span></div><div class="service"><span>AUTH</span><span class="rust">PENDING</span></div></div></section><aside class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><span>MAINTENANCE</span><span class="dim">LOCAL DATA</span></div><div class="overview"><p class="notice">Les données V0.2 sont enregistrées dans le stockage local du navigateur, sans secret API.</p><button class="studio-button secondary" data-reset-studio>RÉINITIALISER LES DONNÉES LOCALES</button></div></aside></div>
